// Checkpoint 2 — Confirm recent sign-in events are available in Log Analytics.
// Validate against synthetic lab activity; redact user identifiers in screenshots.
// A nonzero result is evidence of records in the time window, not proof of full coverage.
SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(24h)
| summarize EventCount=count(), FirstEvent=min(TimeGenerated), LastEvent=max(TimeGenerated)
